'''Crazed Moneko''' (狂乱のもねこ ''Kyōran no Moneko'', '''Crazed Moneko''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[in JAPAN (Crazed Moneko)|in JAPAN]] and [[in LONDON]]. She was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

