==Trivia==
*At 100% strength magnification, Crazed Moneko has the exact same stats as [[Corrupted Moneko (Enemy)|Corrupted Moneko]]. The difference is that Crazed Moneko only appears at 12% or 50% strength magnification, while Corrupted Moneko is at full strength in all of her appearances.
*Along with Corrupted Moneko, she was the first enemy to have an ability that only activates on one part of a multi-hit attack.

